# This project needs no environment variables to run.
#
# `npm install && npm run dev` is sufficient. The only variable the code reads is
# DISABLE_HMR (next.config.ts), which is optional and only useful when hot reload
# misbehaves in a container:
#
#   DISABLE_HMR=true npm run dev
#
# Earlier versions of this file listed GEMINI_API_KEY and APP_URL, inherited from the
# AI Studio scaffold the project was created from. Nothing reads them, and setting
# them has no effect — they are removed to stop them being treated as prerequisites.
